model.py and wan_va_server.py include local fixes used for teacher validation.
For this distribution, model.py additionally makes flash-attn optional for the
existing torch attention backend. The server's sampling implementation is retained.
Unrelated example configs/replay/Qwen/client files are omitted; configs/__init__.py
is an empty registry because PiperPolicy constructs its own explicit configuration.

The Piper adapter implements separate persistent camera caches and real observed
video/issued-command history updates. Download/inference entry points and interface
tests are local integration code. vendor_manifest.json records included file hashes.
